#. Plugin Name of the plugin
#: sm-core.php
msgid "SM Core"
msgstr "SM Core"

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
#: sm-core.php
msgid "https://github.com/fdebbi/steel-marketplace"
msgstr "https://github.com/fdebbi/steel-marketplace"

#. Description of the plugin
#: sm-core.php
msgid ""
"Central foundation of Steel Marketplace: accounts and companies, business "
"activities, permissions, verification, languages (/ar/), notifications, "
"enquiries, audit log and the sm/v1 REST API. Every other sm-* plugin depends"
" on it."
msgstr ""
"Socle de Steel Marketplace : comptes et entreprises, activités, permissions,"
" vérification, langues (/ar/), notifications, demandes, journal d’audit et "
"API REST sm/v1. Toutes les autres extensions sm-* en dépendent."

